[2026-03-14T19:35:56.293Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019PV9SjBmHJptc9YTzVM7Le","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# LinearClone Test Specification\n     2→\n     3→## Login Page (`/login`)\n     4→\n     5→**Components**: LoginForm\n     6→\n     7→### LoginForm\n     8→\n     9→#### Test: Login form renders with email and password fields\n    10→- **Initial state**: User navigates to `/login` (not authenticated)\n    11→- **Expected**: The page displays an email input field, a password input field, a \"Sign in\" button, and a \"Sign up\" link. The form has a clean, centered layout with the app branding.\n    12→\n    13→#### Test: Successful login with valid credentials\n    14→- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\" and password \"password123\"\n    15→- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks the \"Sign in\" button\n    16→- **Expected**: User is redirected to `/my-issues`. A session token is stored in localStorage. The sidebar navigation is visible.\n    17→\n    18→#### Test: Login fails with invalid email\n    19→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    20→- **Action**: User enters \"nonexistent@test.com\" in the email field, \"password123\" in the password field, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    21→- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page. No session token is stored.\n    22→\n    23→#### Test: Login fails with incorrect password\n    24→- **Initial state**: A user account exists with email \"user@test.com\". User is on `/login`.\n    25→- **Action**: User enters \"user@test.com\" in email, \"wrongpassword\" in password, and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    26→- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"Invalid email or password\"). The user remains on the login page.\n    27→\n    28→#### Test: Login form validates required fields\n    29→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    30→- **Action**: User clicks \"Sign in\" without entering email or password\n    31→- **Expected**: Validation errors are shown for both email and password fields indicating they are required.\n    32→\n    33→#### Test: Login form validates email format\n    34→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    35→- **Action**: User enters \"notanemail\" in the email field and clicks \"Sign in\"\n    36→- **Expected**: A validation error is shown indicating the email format is invalid.\n    37→\n    38→#### Test: Navigate to sign up page from login\n    39→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    40→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Sign up\" link\n    41→- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/signup`.\n    42→\n    43→#### Test: Password field masks input\n    44→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`\n    45→- **Action**: User types in the password field\n    46→- **Expected**: The input is masked (displayed as dots/bullets), the field type is \"password\".\n    47→\n    48→#### Test: Login form can be submitted via Enter key\n    49→- **Initial state**: User is on `/login`, has entered valid email and password\n    50→- **Action**: User presses Enter while focused on the password field\n    51→- **Expected**: The form is submitted, same behavior as clicking \"Sign in\".\n    52→\n    53→#### Test: Login redirects authenticated users\n    54→- **Initial state**: User is already authenticated (valid session token in localStorage)\n    55→- **Action**: User navigates to `/login`\n    56→- **Expected**: User is redirected to `/my-issues` instead of seeing the login form.\n    57→\n    58→## Sign Up Page (`/signup`)\n    59→\n    60→**Components**: SignUpForm\n    61→\n    62→### SignUpForm\n    63→\n    64→#### Test: Sign up form renders with name, email, and password fields\n    65→- **Initial state**: User navigates to `/signup` (not authenticated)\n    66→- **Expected**: The page displays a name input field, an email input field, a password input field, a \"Create account\" button, and a \"Log in\" link. The form has a clean, centered layout.\n    67→\n    68→#### Test: Successful account creation\n    69→- **Initial state**: No account exists for \"newuser@test.com\". User is on `/signup`.\n    70→- **Action**: User enters \"Jane Doe\" in name, \"newuser@test.com\" in email, \"securepass123\" in password, and clicks \"Create account\"\n    71→- **Expected**: Account is created. A default workspace is created for the user. User is redirected to `/my-issues`. A session token is stored in localStorage.\n    72→\n    73→#### Test: Sign up fails with existing email\n    74→- **Initial state**: An account already exists with email \"existing@test.com\". User is on `/signup`.\n    75→- **Action**: User enters \"John Doe\" in name, \"existing@test.com\" in email, \"password123\" in password, and clicks \"Create account\"\n    76→- **Expected**: An error message is displayed (e.g., \"An account with this email already exists\"). The user remains on the sign up page.\n    77→\n    78→#### Test: Sign up form validates required fields\n    79→- **Initial state**: User is on `/signup`\n    80→- **Action**: User clicks \"Create account\" without filling in any fields\n    81→- **Expected**: Validation errors are shown for name, email, and password fields indicating they are required.\n    82→\n    83→#### Test: Sign up form validates email format\n    84→- **Initial state**: User is on `/signup`\n    85→- **Action**: User enters \"Jane Doe\" in name, \"bademail\" in email, \"password123\" in password, and clicks \"Create account\"\n    86→- **Expected**: A validation error is shown indicating the email format is invalid.\n    87→\n    88→#### Test: Sign up form validates password minimum length\n    89→- **Initial state**: User is on `/signup`\n    90→- **Action**: User enters \"Jane Doe\" in name, \"jane@test.com\" in email, \"abc\" in password, and clicks \"Create account\"\n    91→- **Expected**: A validation error is shown indicating the password is too short (minimum 8 characters).\n    92→\n    93→#### Test: Navigate to login page from sign up\n    94→- **Initial state**: User is on `/signup`\n    95→- **Action**: User clicks the \"Log in\" link\n    96→- **Expected**: User is navigated to `/login`.\n    97→\n    98→#### Test: Password field masks input on sign up\n    99→- **Initial state**: User is on `/signup`\n   100→- **Action**: User types in the password field"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJzCzLNg8CQ19fUkzZhFgY","session_id":"6da3f93c-eebf-4489-9bbd-9b71bb41a908","uuid":"c2f85573-380f-4b41-811c-8f082b357732"}
